### List all continents
GET {{baseUrl}}/continents
Accept: application/json

### List continents with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/continents?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Get a single continent
GET {{baseUrl}}/continents/NA
Accept: application/json

### List all countries
GET {{baseUrl}}/countries
Accept: application/json

### List countries with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/countries?page=1&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Get a single country
GET {{baseUrl}}/countries/US
Accept: application/json

### List all persons
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons
Accept: application/json

### List persons with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Get a single person
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a person
POST {{baseUrl}}/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "country_code": "US"
}

### Create a person (invalid - missing required fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "country_code": "US"
}
